{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 579947, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 115213, "uid": 154257, "type": 4, "title": "活动零里眼", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1672561803, "updated_at": 1690084823, "updated_uid": 154257, "comment_at": 1690980592, "last_at": 1690980592, "comment_count": 16, "status": 1, "summary": "好家伙，我只不过是加了三天班，再上来就发现居然一语成谶了，但我上次也没奶国服和韩服，所以恐怕也不是日服的问题。从三服整体的热度来看，亏钱我感觉应该不至于，如果不是财报有什么要求的话，可能没有必要搞得这", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 10, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 16305, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "吉林省", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 3, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 579947, "content": "<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\">好家伙，我只不过是加了三天班，再上来就发现居然一语成谶了，但我上次也没奶国服和韩服，所以恐怕也不是日服的问题。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">从三服整体的热度来看，亏钱我感觉应该不至于，如果不是财报有什么要求的话，可能没有必要搞得这么绝，而且之前也没有要摆烂的迹象，韩服甚至刚优化系统。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">从我个人的角度来说，希望这个游戏可以运营下去，哪怕不再更新，只要循环之前的活动也可以的。我猜测这样做的成本不会非常高，实在不行还可以成立个第三方公司的马甲去做，这么多玩家光氪月卡也应该够养活这个项目了。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">如果有人可以组织玩家请【敏感词】愿之类的活动提出类似的建议，或许会有转机也未可知？我现在的工作实在太忙，没有这个能力。但是如果能够复活的话，即使我没时间玩并且游戏也不更新，我承诺每月补票不低于4000日元（即5张月卡）以表示支持。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">当然话说回来，游戏和玩家最终总要先走一个，所有游戏数据最终都是无意义的，玩的过程开心就好，所以眼下大可照玩不误，到关服那天假装临时通知就可以了。最起码保险起见拿完补课再弃坑，不然万一又复活了呢是吧？</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></span><div></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 154257, "username": "时崎狂肝", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/7.png", "description": "人生就像一场电影，总要有人演写攻略的。", "follow_num": 46, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 227688, "content_num": 55, "read_num": 253212, "like_num": 426}, "update_user": {"uid": 154257, "username": "时崎狂肝", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/7.png", "description": "人生就像一场电影，总要有人演写攻略的。", "follow_num": 46, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1164, "name": "天命之子日服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/57/2022/0/26/583959.png", "alias": "dcj", "content_count": 1066, "follow_count": 708}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": [{"uid": 154257, "username": "时崎狂肝", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/7.png", "last_ip_area": "吉林省", "last_login_device_num": 1}], "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg